  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFCA promotes investments in key infrastructures in Central Asia. In order to achieve this objective, a European Financial Institution signs an Indirect Management Agreement with the EC, pooling thus IFCA grants funds with financial instituti. loans.</narrative>
